{"id":"conv_05140","context":"An elderly couple reminisces about countryside summers","ambient":"forest_quiet_birds","cast":["hiroshi_elder","sachiko_grandma"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Remember those summers in the village? The morning dew sparkled on the leaves like diamonds.","jp":"覚えているか、あの村の夏。朝露が葉っぱの上でダイヤモンドみたいに光ってたよな。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,6,7,8,12,16,18,68,124,139,341,439,795,1056,1189,3128,4805,7885,9080,9245,10796,11858,12105],"jpTokens":[{"s":"覚え","r":"おぼえ","w":4805},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"いる","w":18},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"、"},{"s":"あの","w":341},{"s":"村","r":"むら","w":1189},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"夏","r":"なつ","w":795},{"s":"。"},{"s":"朝露","r":"あさつゆ"},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"葉っぱ","r":"はっぱ","w":12105},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"上","r":"うえ","w":124},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"ダイヤモンド","w":9245},{"s":"みたい","w":439},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"光っ","r":"ひかっ","w":9080},{"s":"て","w":139},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"な","w":12},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"Yes, I remember well. You used to run to the elementary school grounds every morning.","jp":"ええ、よく覚えてますよ。あなたは毎朝、小学校のグラウンドまで走って行ってましたねえ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,8,14,28,52,68,165,178,218,320,1056,1508,1573,2033,2685,3039,4781,4805,8420,8513,9285,9971,10869,18099],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"よく","w":178},{"s":"覚え","r":"おぼえ","w":4805},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"あなた","w":218},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"毎朝","r":"まいあさ","w":8420},{"s":"、"},{"s":"小学校","r":"しょうがっこう","w":1508},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"グラウンド","w":9285},{"s":"まで","w":52},{"s":"走っ","r":"はしっ","w":2685},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"行っ","r":"いっ","w":320},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ねえ","w":1573},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"That's right. We'd press our ears to the rails to listen for the train. Looking back, it was reckless play.","jp":"そうそう。線路のレールに耳を当てて、汽車が来るのを待ったもんだ。今思えば、危なっかしい遊びだったな。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,5,6,8,12,21,41,43,61,73,87,99,779,830,984,1294,1362,1609,2861,3195,3718,3755,6712,9303,9485,10404,14290],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"。"},{"s":"線路","r":"せんろ","w":9485},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"レール","w":9303},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"耳","r":"みみ","w":1362},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"当て","r":"あて","w":10404},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"汽車","r":"きしゃ","w":14290},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"来る","r":"くる","w":779},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"待っ","r":"まっ","w":3195},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"もん","w":830},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"},{"s":"今","r":"いま","w":87},{"s":"思え","r":"おもえ","w":99},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"、"},{"s":"危なっかしい","r":"あぶなっかしい"},{"s":"遊び","r":"あそび","w":1609},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"な","w":12},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"Swimming in the river was the same. In the evenings, you could hear the frog chorus from the rice paddies.","jp":"川での水泳もそうですよ。夕方には田んぼでカエルの合唱が聞こえてねえ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,6,7,11,17,61,68,1573,1629,2115,2176,4883,4996,5614,9073,9339,10185,13316,15928],"jpTokens":[{"s":"川","r":"かわ","w":1629},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"水泳","r":"すいえい","w":9073},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"夕方","r":"ゆうがた","w":2115},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"田んぼ","r":"たんぼ","w":10185},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"カエル","w":9339},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"合唱","r":"がっしょう","w":5614},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"聞こえ","r":"きこえ","w":4996},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ねえ","w":1573},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"And at night, the iron bath. You can't get that feeling from today's showers.","jp":"夜は五右衛門風呂だ。あの入浴の気持ちよさは、今のシャワーじゃ味わえん。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,21,25,26,87,132,341,494,5969,6826,9267,12442,13030,13803,15097],"jpTokens":[{"s":"夜","r":"よる","w":494},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"五右衛門風呂","r":"ごえもんぶろ"},{"s":"だ","w":21